  "body": "Set high on the Red Beach side of Stanmore Bay, this architecturally designed coastal home blends flexibility, lifestyle, and breathtaking sea views into one compelling package. Built by award-winning builders on a blank canvas section, the home offers 151sqm of floor area on a generous 612sqm site.\r\n\r\nRecently refreshed with a reconfigured layout and new improvements, the home now offers exceptional flow across two levels. Upstairs has been transformed into a stunning master retreat where elevated Hibiscus Coast views toward Motuora Island are completely heroed through the open-plan living, kitchen, and deck spaces. Vaulted ceilings, natural light, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow create a relaxing coastal atmosphere.\r\n\r\nDownstairs has been redesigned for practical day-to-day living, offering flexible accommodation options ideal for guests, teenagers, dual living, work-from-home setups, or Airbnb potential. One of the multi-use rooms features polished concrete flooring, adding a modern architectural edge.\r\n\r\nThe sleek black-and-white kitchen remains the social hub of the home, complemented by quality appliances and modern finishes throughout. Three bathrooms across the property add convenience and flexibility.\r\n\r\nOutside, the vendor has recently added a brand-new privacy fence and repositioned retaining walls to create additional usable parking space ideal for extra vehicles, a boat, motorhome, or future carport potential (subject to council approval). The easy-care grounds and elevated deck maximise the true north-facing aspect and sunsets.\r\n\r\nBuilt by Downright Construction, recently recognised with a House of the Year Gold Award, the property also benefits from a Master Build Guarantee approaching its third year this November.\r\n\r\nLocated minutes from Silverdale, beaches, schools, motorway access, and coastal walkways.\r\n\r\nPlenty of parking available — please drive in.",
